#. ja: ゴブリンパーチ
#. de: Goblin-Barsch
#. fr: perche gobeline
#. column 2: goblin perch
#. column 8: The goblins claim that they brought this variety of perch back from their years-long pilgrimage into Othard and Ilsabard...because it tasted so divine.<br><br>[Suitable for display in aquariums tier 3 and higher.]<br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
#. column 9: Goblin Perch
msgctxt "Item:5000:0:0"
msgid "goblin perch"
msgstr "гоблинский окунь"

#. de: Goblin-Barsche
#. fr: perches gobelines
#. column 0: goblin perch
#. column 8: The goblins claim that they brought this variety of perch back from their years-long pilgrimage into Othard and Ilsabard...because it tasted so divine.<br><br>[Suitable for display in aquariums tier 3 and higher.]<br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
#. column 9: Goblin Perch
msgctxt "Item:5000:0:2"
msgid "goblin perch"
msgstr "гоблинские окуни"

#. ja: ゴブリン族がエオルゼアに持ち込んだ淡水魚<br>[G3以上の水槽で飼育可能]<br>[魚拓額縁G3に設定可能]
#. de: Die Goblins behaupten, sie hätten diese Barschart von ihren jahrelangen Reisen durch Othard und Ilsabard mitgebracht ... weil der Geschmack einfach göttlich sei. (Kann in Aquarien der Größe L oder größer gehalten werden. Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe L ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: Ce poisson d'eau douce aurait été introduit en Éorzéa par les Gobelins.<br>[Peut être élevé dans un aquarium de grande taille ou supérieure]<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de grande taille]
#. column 0: goblin perch
#. column 2: goblin perch
#. column 9: Goblin Perch
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:5000:0:8"
msgid "The goblins claim that they brought this variety of perch back from their years-long pilgrimage into Othard and Ilsabard...because it tasted so divine.<br><br>[Suitable for display in aquariums tier 3 and higher.]<br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]"
msgstr "Гоблины уверяют, что привезли эту разновидность окуня из многолетнего паломничества по Отарду и Илсабарду... уж больно вкусен он был.<br><br>[Можно поместить в аквариум III уровня и выше.]<br>[Можно выставить в большой раме с ихтиограммой.]"

#. ja: ゴブリンパーチ
