msgstr "Рыба-боец-убийца"

#. ja: スラッジスキッパー
#. de: Schlammskipper
#. fr: gobie mithridatisé
#. column 2: sludgeskippers
#. column 8: Similar to its cousin the mudskipper, the sludgeskipper can also survive outside water for several bells. The sludgeskipper, however, is at home in highly polluted pools where other creatures would likely perish.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Sludgeskipper
msgctxt "Item:5003:0:0"
msgid "sludgeskipper"
msgstr "грязевой прыгун"

#. de: Schlammskipper
#. fr: gobies mithridatisés
#. column 0: sludgeskipper
#. column 8: Similar to its cousin the mudskipper, the sludgeskipper can also survive outside water for several bells. The sludgeskipper, however, is at home in highly polluted pools where other creatures would likely perish.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Sludgeskipper
msgctxt "Item:5003:0:2"
msgid "sludgeskippers"
msgstr "грязевые прыгуны"

#. ja: 毒性の強い汚染された場所に適応した淡水魚<br>[魚拓額縁G1に設定可能]
#. de: Ähnlich wie sein Schlammspringer-Artverwandter kann auch dieser Fisch mehrere Glocken außerhalb des Wassers überleben. Der Schlammskipper ist jedoch in hochgradig verseuchten Teichen anzufinden, in denen andere Kreaturen wohl zugrunde gehen würden. (Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe S ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: Ce poisson d'eau douce possède une résistance à la toxicité qui le rend capable de survivre dans des eaux très souillées.<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de petite taille]
#. column 0: sludgeskipper
#. column 2: sludgeskippers
#. column 9: Sludgeskipper
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:5003:0:8"
msgid "Similar to its cousin the mudskipper, the sludgeskipper can also survive outside water for several bells. The sludgeskipper, however, is at home in highly polluted pools where other creatures would likely perish.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]"
msgstr "Как и его родич илистый прыгун, этот вид может несколько часов обходиться без воды. Но он живёт в таких загрязнённых водоёмах, где прочие существа наверняка погибнут.<br><br>[Можно выставить в маленькой раме с ихтиограммой.]"

