#. ja: イルサバードバス
#. de: Ilsabard-Barsch
#. fr: bar d'Ilsabard
#. column 2: Ilsabardian bass
#. column 8: Unlike its Eorzean cousins, the Ilsabardian bass is mean-tempered and quick to bite, attacking other species sharing the same lake until there are none left but its own.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
