#. ja: キュウケツヤツメ
#. de: Vampir-Neunauge
#. fr: lamproie vampire
#. column 2: vampire lamperns
#. column 8: Just as its name implies, the vampire lampern is indeed a sucker of blood, using its multiple rows of teeth to latch onto its prey, whether it be sea or land creature, and bore a hole from which to drink.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
#. column 9: Vampire Lampern
