#. column 2: wandering sculpin
#. column 8: Legend states that this particular variety of sculpin is a favorite of Oschon, the Wanderer, and that the god will oft dine on this fish while on His journeys through the realm of man.<br><br>[Suitable for display in aquariums tier 2 and higher.]<br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
