#. ja: 腐魚
#. de: Kadaverkarpfen
#. fr: poisson putride
#. column 2: cadaver carp
#. column 8: Neither dead nor necrophagous, the cadaver carp is called such because of where it chooses to live─some of the most tainted, noisome, and foul waters in all of Eorzea.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
