#. ja: マッシュルームクラブ
#. de: Pilzkrabbe
#. fr: crabe champignon
#. column 2: mushroom crabs
#. column 8: This amazing crab will rub its shell up against funguars to collect spores, which it will then grow on its back. Once the sporelings begin to sprout, the crab will use its claws to slice off the mushrooms and eat them.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Mushroom Crab
msgctxt "Item:5022:0:0"
msgid "mushroom crab"
msgstr "грибной краб"

