msgctxt "Item:5034:0:9"
msgid "Dustfish"
msgstr "Пыльная рыбка"

#. ja: サンドストームライダー
#. de: Sturmreiter
#. fr: poisson tempête
#. column 2: storm riders
#. column 8: These sand-dwelling fish will skip across the desert unless they are fortunate enough to stumble across a sandstorm, in which case they will spread their fins and ride the storm great distances.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Storm Rider
msgctxt "Item:5035:0:0"
msgid "storm rider"
msgstr "песчаный буревестник"

#. de: Sturmreiter
#. fr: poissons tempête
#. column 0: storm rider
#. column 8: These sand-dwelling fish will skip across the desert unless they are fortunate enough to stumble across a sandstorm, in which case they will spread their fins and ride the storm great distances.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Storm Rider
msgctxt "Item:5035:0:2"
msgid "storm riders"
msgstr "песчаные буревестники"

#. ja: 砂上を滑空する砂海魚。砂嵐に乗り、驚くほど長距離を移動する<br>[魚拓額縁G1に設定可能]
#. de: Dieser im Sand lebende Fisch hopst durch die Wüste, solange er nicht das Glück hat, auf einen Sandsturm zu stoßen. In diesem Fall breitet er seine Flossen aus und „reitet“ über große Distanzen auf dem Sturm. (Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe S ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: Ce poisson des sables peut planer et se faire porter sur de longues distances par les vents des tempêtes de sable.<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de petite taille]
#. column 0: storm rider
#. column 2: storm riders
#. column 9: Storm Rider
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:5035:0:8"
msgid "These sand-dwelling fish will skip across the desert unless they are fortunate enough to stumble across a sandstorm, in which case they will spread their fins and ride the storm great distances.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]"
msgstr "Эти обитатели песков скачут по пустыне, пока им не повезёт попасть в песчаную бурю. Тогда они расправляют плавники и уносятся на буре на огромные расстояния.<br><br>[Можно выставить в маленькой раме с ихтиограммой.]"

#. ja: サンドストームライダー
#. de: Sturmreiter
#. fr: Poisson tempête
#. column 0: storm rider
#. column 2: storm riders
