msgctxt "Item:5038:0:8"
msgid "Cloud jellyfish aimlessly drift about the Sea of Clouds, tentacles spread out below them, searching for the small birds on which they feed.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]"
msgstr "Облачные медузы бесцельно дрейфуют над Морем облаков, свесив щупальца и высматривая мелких птиц, которыми питаются.<br><br>[Можно выставить в маленькой раме с ихтиограммой.]"

#. ja: クラウドジェリー
#. de: Wolkenqualle
#. fr: Méduse cumulus
#. column 0: cloud jellyfish
#. column 2: cloud jellyfish
#. column 8: Cloud jellyfish aimlessly drift about the Sea of Clouds, tentacles spread out below them, searching for the small birds on which they feed.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
msgctxt "Item:5038:0:9"
msgid "Cloud Jellyfish"
msgstr "Облачная медуза"

#. ja: スカイフィッシュ
#. de: Luftfisch
#. fr: fulgure
#. column 2: skyfish
#. column 8: One of the more common creatures found living on the thermal currents above the Sea of Clouds, from a distance, the skyfish appears to be no more than a simple rod outfitted with three sets of transparent wings.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Skyfish
msgctxt "Item:5039:0:0"
msgid "skyfish"
msgstr "небесная рыбка"

