msgctxt "Item:5039:0:9"
msgid "Skyfish"
msgstr "Небесная рыбка"

#. ja: スプリットクラウド
#. de: Wolkenspalter
#. fr: brise-nuage
#. column 2: cloud cutters
#. column 8: The swiftest inhabitants of the Sea of Clouds, cloud cutters will fly straight in a single direction for malms before quickly turning at some unthinkable angle and darting off in another direction.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Cloud Cutter
msgctxt "Item:5040:0:0"
msgid "cloud cutter"
msgstr "рассекатель облаков"

#. de: Wolkenspalter
#. fr: brise-nuage
#. column 0: cloud cutter
#. column 8: The swiftest inhabitants of the Sea of Clouds, cloud cutters will fly straight in a single direction for malms before quickly turning at some unthinkable angle and darting off in another direction.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Cloud Cutter
msgctxt "Item:5040:0:2"
msgid "cloud cutters"
msgstr "рассекатели облаков"

#. ja: 雲を切り裂くように舞う雲海魚<br>[魚拓額縁G2に設定可能]
#. de: Der schnellste Bewohner des Wolkenmeeres. Diese Spezies fliegt oft mehrere Malme geradeaus, um dann plötzlich in nahezu unmöglichen Winkeln die Richtung zu ändern. (Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe M ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: Ce poisson des milieux nuageux plane et semble trancher les nuages.<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de taille moyenne]
#. column 0: cloud cutter
#. column 2: cloud cutters
#. column 9: Cloud Cutter
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:5040:0:8"
msgid "The swiftest inhabitants of the Sea of Clouds, cloud cutters will fly straight in a single direction for malms before quickly turning at some unthinkable angle and darting off in another direction.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]"
msgstr "Самые быстрые обитатели Моря облаков. Они летят прямо на многие мальмы, а затем резко меняют курс под немыслимым углом и умчатся в другую сторону.<br><br>[Можно выставить в средней раме с ихтиограммой.]"

