msgctxt "Item:5040:0:9"
msgid "Cloud Cutter"
msgstr "Рассекатель облаков"

#. ja: フライマンタ
#. de: blind[a] Manta
#. fr: manta volante
#. column 2: blind mantas
#. column 8: The blind manta is thought to navigate the Sea of Clouds in a manner similar to how bats keep their bearings─using sound and echoes to determine the location of cliff faces and other creatures.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
#. column 9: Blind Manta
msgctxt "Item:5041:0:0"
msgid "blind manta"
msgstr "слепой скат"

#. de: blind[a] Mantas
#. fr: mantas volantes
#. column 0: blind manta
#. column 8: The blind manta is thought to navigate the Sea of Clouds in a manner similar to how bats keep their bearings─using sound and echoes to determine the location of cliff faces and other creatures.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
#. column 9: Blind Manta
msgctxt "Item:5041:0:2"
msgid "blind mantas"
msgstr "слепые скаты"

#. ja: 扁平な身体をエーテル翼として浮行する雲海魚<br>[魚拓額縁G3に設定可能]
#. de: Der blinde Manta navigiert ähnlich wie Fledermäuse durch das Wolkenmeer. Er nutzt Geräusche und Echos, um das Gelände und Kreaturen zu erkennen. (Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe L ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: Le corps aplati de ce poisson des nuages lui permet de planer sur l'énergie éthérée qui flotte dans l'air.<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de grande taille]
#. column 0: blind manta
#. column 2: blind mantas
#. column 9: Blind Manta
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:5041:0:8"
msgid "The blind manta is thought to navigate the Sea of Clouds in a manner similar to how bats keep their bearings─using sound and echoes to determine the location of cliff faces and other creatures.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]"
msgstr "Считается, что слепой скат ориентируется в Море облаков, как летучая мышь: по звукам и эху определяет, где находятся отвесные скалы и другие существа.<br><br>[Можно выставить в большой раме с ихтиограммой.]"

#. ja: フライマンタ
#. de: Blinder Manta
#. fr: Manta volante
#. column 0: blind manta
#. column 2: blind mantas
#. column 8: The blind manta is thought to navigate the Sea of Clouds in a manner similar to how bats keep their bearings─using sound and echoes to determine the location of cliff faces and other creatures.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
msgctxt "Item:5041:0:9"
msgid "Blind Manta"
msgstr "Слепой скат"

#. ja: リフトセイラー
#. de: Kluftsegler
#. fr: timonier du ciel
#. column 2: rift sailors
#. column 8: The rift sailor uses the light elastic webbing between its wings to catch the roiling winds of the Sea of Clouds and glide across the rifts.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Rift Sailor
msgctxt "Item:5042:0:0"
msgid "rift sailor"
msgstr "парусник разломов"

#. de: Kluftsegler
#. fr: timoniers du ciel
#. column 0: rift sailor
#. column 8: The rift sailor uses the light elastic webbing between its wings to catch the roiling winds of the Sea of Clouds and glide across the rifts.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Rift Sailor
msgctxt "Item:5042:0:2"
msgid "rift sailors"
msgstr "парусники разломов"

#. ja: 帆船の帆のような膜に風を受けて浮行する雲海魚<br>[魚拓額縁G2に設定可能]
#. de: Der Kluftsegler nutzt das elastische Gewebe zwischen seinen Flügeln, um die gewaltigen Winde im Wolkenmeer einzufangen und über Abgründe zu gleiten. (Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe M ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: Ce poisson des nuages se déplace en laissant le vent gonfler sa membrane, comme la voile d'un navire.<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de taille moyenne]
#. column 0: rift sailor
#. column 2: rift sailors
#. column 9: Rift Sailor
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:5042:0:8"
msgid "The rift sailor uses the light elastic webbing between its wings to catch the roiling winds of the Sea of Clouds and glide across the rifts.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]"
msgstr "Парусник разломов ловит мощные ветра Моря облаков упругими перепонками между крыльями и скользит над разломами.<br><br>[Можно выставить в средней раме с ихтиограммой.]"

