#. column 2: caravan eels
#. column 8: After maturing in the Grand Wake, caravan eels will form long lines in the sand and make their way back to the Sagolii Desert to spawn and die.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
msgctxt "Item:5045:0:9"
msgid "Caravan Eel"
msgstr "Караванный угорь"

#. ja: ラムフォリンクス
#. de: Rhamphorhynchus
#. fr: rhamphorhynchus
#. column 2: rhamphorhynchus
#. column 8: Its massive lance-shaped nose makes this legendary denizen of the Sea of Clouds a formidable nuisance for airships passing through the area.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on extra large canvases.]
#. column 9: Rhamphorhynchus
msgctxt "Item:5046:0:0"
msgid "rhamphorhynchus"
msgstr "рамфоринх"

