#. fr: amulettes d'Oschon
#. column 0: Oschon's finger charm
#. column 8: When a thief is caught, a common punishment is to remove a number of fingers proportional to the value of the items stolen. These fingers are then taken and blessed by anointed priests of Oschon, the Wanderer. It is thought that, when carried on a journey, these fingers will point out the safest routes, and are therefore cherished by caravan drivers and traveling merchants throughout Eorzea.
#. column 9: Oschon's Finger
msgctxt "Item:5885:0:2"
msgid "Oschon's finger charms"
msgstr "пальцы Ошона"

#. ja: 旅神オシュオンの祝福が込められた骨製のお守り
#. de: Dieser Talisman wurde aus einem Finger gefertigt, der von einem überführten Dieb stammt. Werden solche Finger von Priestern des Oschon gesegnet, sollen sie Wanderern immer den sichersten Weg zeigen.
#. fr: Cette amulette en os renferme la bénédiction d'Oschon, le dieu voyageur.
#. column 0: Oschon's finger charm
#. column 2: Oschon's finger charms
#. column 9: Oschon's Finger
msgctxt "Item:5885:0:8"
msgid "When a thief is caught, a common punishment is to remove a number of fingers proportional to the value of the items stolen. These fingers are then taken and blessed by anointed priests of Oschon, the Wanderer. It is thought that, when carried on a journey, these fingers will point out the safest routes, and are therefore cherished by caravan drivers and traveling merchants throughout Eorzea."
msgstr "Пойманному вору обычно отрубают пальцы — число зависит от стоимости украденного. Затем пальцы благословляют посвящённые жрецы Ошона, Странника. Считается, что в дороге они указывают самый безопасный путь, поэтому караванщики и торговцы по всей Эорзее их ценят."

#. ja: 旅神のお守り
#. de: Talisman des Wanderers
#. fr: Amulette d'Oschon
#. column 0: Oschon's finger charm
#. column 2: Oschon's finger charms
#. column 8: When a thief is caught, a common punishment is to remove a number of fingers proportional to the value of the items stolen. These fingers are then taken and blessed by anointed priests of Oschon, the Wanderer. It is thought that, when carried on a journey, these fingers will point out the safest routes, and are therefore cherished by caravan drivers and traveling merchants throughout Eorzea.
msgctxt "Item:5885:0:9"
msgid "Oschon's Finger"
msgstr "Палец Ошона"

